      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) A declaration under subsection (3A):\n\n(a) comes into force when it is made, or on such later day as is\nspecified in the declaration; and\n\n(b) ceases to be in force at the end of the period of 40 sitting\ndays of a House of the Parliament after the declaration comes\ninto force.",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) A declaration under subsection (3A):\n\n(a) comes into force when it is made, or on such later day as is\nspecified in the declaration; and\n\n(b) ceases to be in force at the end of the period of 40 sitting\ndays of a House of the Parliament after the declaration comes\ninto force.",
      "values:partOf": {
