    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187A(4) Service providers must keep certain information and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(4) This section does not require a service provider to keep, or cause to\nbe kept:\n\n(a) information that is the contents or substance of a\ncommunication; or\nNote:\nThis paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not\nrequired to keep information about telecommunications content.\n\n(b) information that:\n\n(i) states an address to which a communication was sent on\nthe internet, from a telecommunications device, using\nan internet access service provided by the service\nprovider; and\n\n(ii) was obtained by the service provider only as a result of\nproviding the service; or\nNote:\nThis paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not\nrequired to keep information about subscribers’ web browsing\nhistory.\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "skos:definition": "(4) This section does not require a service provider to keep, or cause to\nbe kept:\n\n(a) information that is the contents or substance of a\ncommunication; or\nNote:\nThis paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not\nrequired to keep information about telecommunications content.\n\n(b) information that:\n\n(i) states an address to which a communication was sent on\nthe internet, from a telecommunications device, using\nan internet access service provided by the service\nprovider; and\n\n(ii) was obtained by the service provider only as a result of\nproviding the service; or\nNote:\nThis paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not\nrequired to keep information about subscribers’ web browsing\nhistory.\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b91330651eaf6c0e33169939cbe36e798a11faf5545fd252a9307b88e2041d36",
      "skos:note": "Service providers must keep certain information.",
      "dc:description": "(4) This section does not require a service provider to keep, or cause to be kept:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187A(4) Service providers must keep certain information and",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(4) This section does not require a service provider to keep, or cause to\nbe kept:\n\n(a) information that is the contents or substance of a\ncommunication; or\nNote:\nThis paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not\nrequired to keep information about telecommunications content.\n\n(b) information that:\n\n(i) states an address to which a communication was sent on\nthe internet, from a telecommunications device, using\nan internet access service provided by the service\nprovider; and\n\n(ii) was obtained by the service provider only as a result of\nproviding the service; or\nNote:\nThis paragraph puts beyond doubt that service providers are not\nrequired to keep information about subscribers’ web browsing\nhistory.\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies"
    },
