    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187aa",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187AA Information to be kept",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187aa"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table sets out the kinds of information that a service\nprovider must keep, or cause to be kept, under subsection 187A(1):\n\nKinds of information to be kept\nItem\nTopic\nColumn 1\nDescription of information\nColumn 2\nThe subscriber of,\nand accounts,\nservices,\ntelecommunications\ndevices and other\nrelevant services\nrelating to, the\nrelevant service\nThe following:\n(a) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) any name or address information;\n(ii) any other information for identification\npurposes;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider for the\npurposes of identifying the subscriber of the\nrelevant service;\n(b) any information relating to any contract,\nagreement or arrangement relating to the\nrelevant service, or to any related account,\nservice or device;\n(c) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) billing or payment information;\n(ii) contact information;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\nrelation to the relevant service;\n(d) any identifiers relating to the relevant service or\nany related account, service or device, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The following table sets out the kinds of information that a service\nprovider must keep, or cause to be kept, under subsection 187A(1):\n\nKinds of information to be kept\nItem\nTopic\nColumn 1\nDescription of information\nColumn 2\nThe subscriber of,\nand accounts,\nservices,\ntelecommunications\ndevices and other\nrelevant services\nrelating to, the\nrelevant service\nThe following:\n(a) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) any name or address information;\n(ii) any other information for identification\npurposes;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider for the\npurposes of identifying the subscriber of the\nrelevant service;\n(b) any information relating to any contract,\nagreement or arrangement relating to the\nrelevant service, or to any related account,\nservice or device;\n(c) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) billing or payment information;\n(ii) contact information;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\nrelation to the relevant service;\n(d) any identifiers relating to the relevant service or\nany related account, service or device, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187aa-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187aa-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7bc4a5fb29ecde05c684e81b635ab92a818e1023895daa460f6de8ab5f241979",
      "skos:note": "Must keep certain information about subscribers and services.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187aa",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187AA Information to be kept",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following table sets out the kinds of information that a service\nprovider must keep, or cause to be kept, under subsection 187A(1):\n\nKinds of information to be kept\nItem\nTopic\nColumn 1\nDescription of information\nColumn 2\nThe subscriber of,\nand accounts,\nservices,\ntelecommunications\ndevices and other\nrelevant services\nrelating to, the\nrelevant service\nThe following:\n(a) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) any name or address information;\n(ii) any other information for identification\npurposes;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider for the\npurposes of identifying the subscriber of the\nrelevant service;\n(b) any information relating to any contract,\nagreement or arrangement relating to the\nrelevant service, or to any related account,\nservice or device;\n(c) any information that is one or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) billing or payment information;\n(ii) contact information;\nrelating to the relevant service, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\nrelation to the relevant service;\n(d) any identifiers relating to the relevant service or\nany related account, service or device, being\ninformation used by the service provider in\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187aa-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
