    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187ba",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187BA Ensuring the confidentiality of information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187ba"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "A service provider must protect the confidentiality of information\nthat, or information in a document that, the service provider must\nkeep, or cause to be kept, under section 187A by:\n\n(a) encrypting the information; and\n\n(b) protecting the information from unauthorised interference or\nunauthorised access.",
      "skos:definition": "A service provider must protect the confidentiality of information\nthat, or information in a document that, the service provider must\nkeep, or cause to be kept, under section 187A by:\n\n(a) encrypting the information; and\n\n(b) protecting the information from unauthorised interference or\nunauthorised access.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187ba-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187ba-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a0945ba12cfb1eeffc6efd5b5bc3b53b689b1d81cac9150a06b2e1d5bab79eb0",
      "skos:note": "Must protect confidentiality of information",
      "dc:description": "Protection measures (encryption, protection from unauthorized interference/access)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187ba",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187BA Ensuring the confidentiality of information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "A service provider must protect the confidentiality of information\nthat, or information in a document that, the service provider must\nkeep, or cause to be kept, under section 187A by:\n\n(a) encrypting the information; and\n\n(b) protecting the information from unauthorised interference or\nunauthorised access."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187ba-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187ba"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187ba-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to protect confidentiality",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187C Period for keeping information and documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The period for which a service provider must keep, or cause to be\nkept, information or a document under section 187A is:\n\n(a) if the information is about, or the document contains\ninformation about, a matter of a kind described in\nparagraph (a) or (b) in column 2 of item 1 of the table in\nsubsection 187AA(1)—the period:\n\n(i) starting when the information or document came into\nexistence; and\n\n(ii) ending 2 years after the closure of the account to which\nthe information or document relates; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the period:\n\n(i) starting when the information or document came into\nexistence; and\n\n(ii) ending 2 years after it came into existence.\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The period for which a service provider must keep, or cause to be\nkept, information or a document under section 187A is:\n\n(a) if the information is about, or the document contains\ninformation about, a matter of a kind described in\nparagraph (a) or (b) in column 2 of item 1 of the table in\nsubsection 187AA(1)—the period:\n\n(i) starting when the information or document came into\nexistence; and\n\n(ii) ending 2 years after the closure of the account to which\nthe information or document relates; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the period:\n\n(i) starting when the information or document came into\nexistence; and\n\n(ii) ending 2 years after it came into existence.\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187c-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0ea6e9764bd90d8e7dfd7ea2449fc1eaa91841fe4eed0d56c96c1da4a25ee986",
      "skos:note": "Period for keeping information and documents"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "187C Period for keeping information and documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The period for which a service provider must keep, or cause to be\nkept, information or a document under section 187A is:\n\n(a) if the information is about, or the document contains\ninformation about, a matter of a kind described in\nparagraph (a) or (b) in column 2 of item 1 of the table in\nsubsection 187AA(1)—the period:\n\n(i) starting when the information or document came into\nexistence; and\n\n(ii) ending 2 years after the closure of the account to which\nthe information or document relates; or\n\n(b) otherwise—the period:\n\n(i) starting when the information or document came into\nexistence; and\n\n(ii) ending 2 years after it came into existence.\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies"
    },
