    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187kb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "187KB Commonwealth may make a grant of financial assistance to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-187kb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "service providers\n\n(1) The Commonwealth may make a grant of financial assistance to a\nservice provider for the purpose of assisting the service provider to\ncomply with the service provider’s obligations under this Part.\n\n(2) The terms and conditions on which that financial assistance is\ngranted are to be set out in a written agreement between the\nCommonwealth and the service provider.\n\n(3) An agreement under subsection (2) may be entered into on behalf\nof the Commonwealth by the Minister.",
      "skos:definition": "service providers\n\n(1) The Commonwealth may make a grant of financial assistance to a\nservice provider for the purpose of assisting the service provider to\ncomply with the service provider’s obligations under this Part.\n\n(2) The terms and conditions on which that financial assistance is\ngranted are to be set out in a written agreement between the\nCommonwealth and the service provider.\n\n(3) An agreement under subsection (2) may be entered into on behalf\nof the Commonwealth by the Minister.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-187kb-ss-1"
        },
