      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "(1A) The review:\n\nCo-operation with agencies  Chapter 5\nData retention  Part 5-1A\nMiscellaneous  Division 4\n\nSection 187P\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) must start on or before the second anniversary of the end of\nthe implementation phase; and\n\n(b) must be concluded on or before the third anniversary of the\nend of the implementation phase."
    },
