      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "relation to a kind of telecommunications service\n\n(1) Each carrier supplying a particular kind of telecommunications\nservice that is not covered by any determination under section 189\nbut that involves, or will involve, the use of a telecommunications\nsystem must ensure that the kind of service or the system has the\ncapability to:\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "skos:definition": "relation to a kind of telecommunications service\n\n(1) Each carrier supplying a particular kind of telecommunications\nservice that is not covered by any determination under section 189\nbut that involves, or will involve, the use of a telecommunications\nsystem must ensure that the kind of service or the system has the\ncapability to:\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
