      "values:originalText": "(3) If the carrier became a carrier on a day (the start day) after the\ncommencement of this section, the carrier must also give an IC\nplan to a Communications Access Coordinator within 90 days after\nthe start day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-196-ss-3-norm",
