      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a carrier or a nominated carriage service provider gives a\nCommunications Access Coordinator an IC plan under section 196,\n197 or 201, or an amended IC plan under this section, a\nCommunications Access Coordinator must, within 60 days of the\nplan being received:\n\n(a) approve the plan and notify the carrier or provider of the\napproval; or\n\n(b) give the plan back to the carrier or provider with a written\nrequest for the carrier or provider to give a Communications\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a carrier or a nominated carriage service provider gives a\nCommunications Access Coordinator an IC plan under section 196,\n197 or 201, or an amended IC plan under this section, a\nCommunications Access Coordinator must, within 60 days of the\nplan being received:\n\n(a) approve the plan and notify the carrier or provider of the\napproval; or\n\n(b) give the plan back to the carrier or provider with a written\nrequest for the carrier or provider to give a Communications\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-198-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-198-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "355705210644a096a5febfd2fd283c26874059035ab19737e02f0c23009fbdb1",
      "skos:note": "Must approve IC plan within 60 days",
      "dc:description": "approval and notification"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-198",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "198 Consideration of IC plans",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a carrier or a nominated carriage service provider gives a\nCommunications Access Coordinator an IC plan under section 196,\n197 or 201, or an amended IC plan under this section, a\nCommunications Access Coordinator must, within 60 days of the\nplan being received:\n\n(a) approve the plan and notify the carrier or provider of the\napproval; or\n\n(b) give the plan back to the carrier or provider with a written\nrequest for the carrier or provider to give a Communications\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies"
    },
