      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) applies only if the change in business plans has, or\nis likely to have, a material adverse effect on the ability of the\ncarrier or provider to comply with its obligations under Part 5-3.\n\nCo-operation with agencies  Chapter 5\nInterception capability plans  Part 5-4\n\nSection 202\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) applies only if the change in business plans has, or\nis likely to have, a material adverse effect on the ability of the\ncarrier or provider to comply with its obligations under Part 5-3.\n\nCo-operation with agencies  Chapter 5\nInterception capability plans  Part 5-4\n\nSection 202\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-201"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-201-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-201-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a08b469ec7e9b65e697f92ded55c899efafb37ed8d8cde62e701279b2e1ed5ae",
      "skos:note": "Material adverse effect on compliance with obligations under Part 5-3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-201-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "201(2) Consequences of changed business plans",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) applies only if the change in business plans has, or\nis likely to have, a material adverse effect on the ability of the\ncarrier or provider to comply with its obligations under Part 5-3.\n\nCo-operation with agencies  Chapter 5\nInterception capability plans  Part 5-4\n\nSection 202\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-201-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
