    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-202b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "202B(5) Carrier or provider to notify of proposed change",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-202b-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(5) After notifying a Communications Access Coordinator of a\nproposed change, the carrier or provider may implement the\nchange if the carrier or provider has not been notified in writing by\na Communications Access Coordinator within 30 days after the\nday the carrier or provider notifies a Communications Access\nCoordinator of the proposed change.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) After notifying a Communications Access Coordinator of a\nproposed change, the carrier or provider may implement the\nchange if the carrier or provider has not been notified in writing by\na Communications Access Coordinator within 30 days after the\nday the carrier or provider notifies a Communications Access\nCoordinator of the proposed change.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-202b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-202b-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-202b-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9989bb0212e70f031ee72438eedb26e1d82450365649649d6b03e7c1d20a413d",
      "skos:note": "Carrier or provider must notify of proposed change within 30 days.",
      "dc:description": "Notification in writing by Communications Access Coordinator"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-202b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "202B(5) Carrier or provider to notify of proposed change",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(5) After notifying a Communications Access Coordinator of a\nproposed change, the carrier or provider may implement the\nchange if the carrier or provider has not been notified in writing by\na Communications Access Coordinator within 30 days after the\nday the carrier or provider notifies a Communications Access\nCoordinator of the proposed change."
    },
