      "values:originalText": "(6) If:\n\n(a) a Communications Access Coordinator notifies the carrier or\nprovider in writing within 30 days after the day the carrier or\nprovider notifies a Communications Access Coordinator of\nthe proposed change; and\n\nChapter 5  Co-operation with agencies",
