    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-202c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "202C Communications Access Coordinator may notify agencies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-202c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "(1) After a Communications Access Coordinator has been notified by\na carrier or nominated carriage service provider of an intention to\nimplement a proposed change, a Communications Access\nCoordinator may notify agencies that are likely to be interested of\nthe proposed change.\n\n(2) On receiving notification from a carrier or provider of an intention\nto implement a proposed change, a Communications Access\nCoordinator, and each agency that receives notification of the\nproposed change, must treat the proposed change as confidential.\n\nCo-operation with agencies  Chapter 5\nDelivery capability  Part 5-5\n\nSection 203\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) After a Communications Access Coordinator has been notified by\na carrier or nominated carriage service provider of an intention to\nimplement a proposed change, a Communications Access\nCoordinator may notify agencies that are likely to be interested of\nthe proposed change.\n\n(2) On receiving notification from a carrier or provider of an intention\nto implement a proposed change, a Communications Access\nCoordinator, and each agency that receives notification of the\nproposed change, must treat the proposed change as confidential.\n\nCo-operation with agencies  Chapter 5\nDelivery capability  Part 5-5\n\nSection 203\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
