      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "agreements\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) there is an agreement between Australia and one or more\nforeign countries; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things) the issue of\norders (however described) by a competent authority\n(however described) of the foreign country, or each of the\nforeign countries, concerned.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "agreements\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) there is an agreement between Australia and one or more\nforeign countries; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things) the issue of\norders (however described) by a competent authority\n(however described) of the foreign country, or each of the\nforeign countries, concerned.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-3b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-3b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "05c56afe6460bebd9580d2b8ee3b5d1b054a8898f95a4343bf6afce47f1e29c5",
      "skos:note": "Statutory requirements for international agreements regarding orders by a competent authority of a foreign country."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-3b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3B Statutory requirements certificate—designated international",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 85,
      "values:originalText": "agreements\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) there is an agreement between Australia and one or more\nforeign countries; and\n\n(b) the agreement deals with (among other things) the issue of\norders (however described) by a competent authority\n(however described) of the foreign country, or each of the\nforeign countries, concerned.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders"
    },
    {
