    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-17",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17 Nominated ART Intelligence and Security member",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-17"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who:\n\n(a) holds one of the following appointments to the\nAdministrative Review Tribunal:\n\n(ii) senior member;\n\n(iii) general member; and\n\n(b) is a member of the Intelligence and Security jurisdictional\narea of the Administrative Review Tribunal;\nto issue international production orders under Part 4 of this\nSchedule.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who:\n\n(a) holds one of the following appointments to the\nAdministrative Review Tribunal:\n\n(ii) senior member;\n\n(iii) general member; and\n\n(b) is a member of the Intelligence and Security jurisdictional\narea of the Administrative Review Tribunal;\nto issue international production orders under Part 4 of this\nSchedule.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-17-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-17-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ebf544213ea206f0c64bdc0ffb0dbd6ccc7a1e054864d40bf044374771ba8259",
      "skos:note": "The Attorney-General may nominate a person to issue international production orders."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-17",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17 Nominated ART Intelligence and Security member",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 95,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who:\n\n(a) holds one of the following appointments to the\nAdministrative Review Tribunal:\n\n(ii) senior member;\n\n(iii) general member; and\n\n(b) is a member of the Intelligence and Security jurisdictional\narea of the Administrative Review Tribunal;\nto issue international production orders under Part 4 of this\nSchedule.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-17-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-17"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: Agent"
    },
