    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(3) Application for international production order—enforcement of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-22-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The application must be made on the interception agency’s behalf\nby:\n\n(a) in the case of the Australian Federal Police—a member of the\nAustralian Federal Police; or\n\n(b) in the case of the National Anti-Corruption Commission:\n\n(i) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or\n\n(ii) a National Anti-Corruption Deputy Commissioner; or\n\n(iii) a staff member of the NACC who is authorised in\nwriting by the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner\nfor the purposes of this paragraph; or\n\n(c) in the case of the ACC:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The application must be made on the interception agency’s behalf\nby:\n\n(a) in the case of the Australian Federal Police—a member of the\nAustralian Federal Police; or\n\n(b) in the case of the National Anti-Corruption Commission:\n\n(i) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or\n\n(ii) a National Anti-Corruption Deputy Commissioner; or\n\n(iii) a staff member of the NACC who is authorised in\nwriting by the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner\nfor the purposes of this paragraph; or\n\n(c) in the case of the ACC:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3236efd1d0e9c8e5379bff2db3e1f66e6be55ad0cc22b5fa8747cbf2ed8ae412",
      "skos:note": "Application must be made by authorized personnel"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-22-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(3) Application for international production order—enforcement of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The application must be made on the interception agency’s behalf\nby:\n\n(a) in the case of the Australian Federal Police—a member of the\nAustralian Federal Police; or\n\n(b) in the case of the National Anti-Corruption Commission:\n\n(i) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or\n\n(ii) a National Anti-Corruption Deputy Commissioner; or\n\n(iii) a staff member of the NACC who is authorised in\nwriting by the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner\nfor the purposes of this paragraph; or\n\n(c) in the case of the ACC:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders"
    },
    {
