    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "25(3) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-25-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual transmission services, the affidavit must\nset out the following information, so far as it can be derived from\nthe interception agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the agency has made under clause 22\nin relation to those individual transmission services;\n\n(b) the number of international production orders (if any)\npreviously issued in response to such applications;\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of intercepted\ncommunications made available to the agency under such\norders.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual transmission services, the affidavit must\nset out the following information, so far as it can be derived from\nthe interception agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the agency has made under clause 22\nin relation to those individual transmission services;\n\n(b) the number of international production orders (if any)\npreviously issued in response to such applications;\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of intercepted\ncommunications made available to the agency under such\norders.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "962b356d79c81f18f253808ef4999a06cac7e25a1c4642d78ab4dec1336db610",
      "skos:note": "Must provide information about previous applications and orders for international production.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-25-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25(3) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual transmission services, the affidavit must\nset out the following information, so far as it can be derived from\nthe interception agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the agency has made under clause 22\nin relation to those individual transmission services;\n\n(b) the number of international production orders (if any)\npreviously issued in response to such applications;\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of intercepted\ncommunications made available to the agency under such\norders."
    },
