    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "25(4) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-25-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual message/call application services, the\naffidavit must set out the following information, so far as it can be\nderived from the interception agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the agency has made under clause 22\nin relation to those individual message/call application\nservices;\n\n(b) the number of international production orders (if any)\npreviously issued in response to such applications;\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of intercepted\nmessages, voice calls or video calls made available to the\nagency under such orders.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the application is for an international production order in respect\nof one or more individual message/call application services, the\naffidavit must set out the following information, so far as it can be\nderived from the interception agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for international\nproduction orders that the agency has made under clause 22\nin relation to those individual message/call application\nservices;\n\n(b) the number of international production orders (if any)\npreviously issued in response to such applications;\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of intercepted\nmessages, voice calls or video calls made available to the\nagency under such orders.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25"
      },
