    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "25(5) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-25-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Despite subclause (1), a written application may be accompanied\nby 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, apart\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to the enforcement of the criminal law  Part 2\nInternational production orders relating to interception: enforcement of the criminal law",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Despite subclause (1), a written application may be accompanied\nby 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, apart\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to the enforcement of the criminal law  Part 2\nInternational production orders relating to interception: enforcement of the criminal law",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-25-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6bdeefb9e2e747eb0f10bbd33ca7cf9b1e7d7d109aa45908ec3785dc5bade0ab",
      "skos:note": "Written application may be accompanied by 2 or more affidavits"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-25-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25(5) Affidavits to accompany written application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Despite subclause (1), a written application may be accompanied\nby 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, apart\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to the enforcement of the criminal law  Part 2\nInternational production orders relating to interception: enforcement of the criminal law"
    },
