      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the eligible Judge or\nnominated ART member directs.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the eligible Judge or\nnominated ART member directs.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
