      "values:originalText": "(4) The chief officer of the criminal law-enforcement agency may, in\nwriting, nominate for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(b)(ii) an\noffice or position in the agency that is involved in the management\nof the agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The chief officer of the criminal law-enforcement agency may, in\nwriting, nominate for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(b)(ii) an\noffice or position in the agency that is involved in the management\nof the agency.",
