      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.126",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\ndisclose telecommunications data to the criminal law-enforcement\nagency, the order may require the provider to disclose that data to\nthe agency in a specified way.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the order directs a prescribed communications provider to\ndisclose telecommunications data to the criminal law-enforcement\nagency, the order may require the provider to disclose that data to\nthe agency in a specified way.",
      "values:partOf": {
