      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.141",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency of Victoria applies,\nunder clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member\nfor an international production order under clause 60 that is in\nrespect of:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency of Victoria applies,\nunder clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member\nfor an international production order under clause 60 that is in\nrespect of:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
