      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.142",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if a Part 5.3 IPO agency of Queensland applies,\nunder clause 52, to an eligible Judge or nominated ART member\nfor an international production order under clause 60 that is in\nrespect of:\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to Part 5.3 supervisory orders  Part 3\nInternational production orders relating to interception: Part 5.3 supervisory orders",
