      "values:originalText": "(4) The chief officer of the Part 5.3 IPO agency may, in writing,\nnominate for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(b)(ii) an office or\nposition in the agency that is involved in the management of the\nagency.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The chief officer of the Part 5.3 IPO agency may, in writing,\nnominate for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(b)(ii) an office or\nposition in the agency that is involved in the management of the\nagency.",
