      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A nomination under subclause (4) is not a legislative instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A nomination under subclause (4) is not a legislative instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
