      "cml:integrityHash": "fd73f792e41b912cbfe1732a2954d79532ef9cfeb235bef0a7470b29f51abac9",
      "skos:note": "Requirement to make stored communications available to the Part 5.3 IPO agency directly or indirectly."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-70-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70(5) Content of international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 164,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A requirement under subclause (4) may:\n\n(a) require that a copy of stored communications be made\navailable to the Part 5.3 IPO agency directly; or\n\n(b) require that a copy of stored communications be made\navailable to the Part 5.3 IPO agency indirectly via the\nAustralian Designated Authority."
    },
