    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-88",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "88 Giving further information to nominated ART Intelligence and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-88"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "Security member\n\n(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require\nfurther information to be given in connection with an application\nunder clause 83 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember for an international production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART\nIntelligence and Security member directs.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to national security  Part 4\nInternational production orders relating to interception: national security  Division 2\n\nClause 89\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ninterception",
      "skos:definition": "Security member\n\n(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require\nfurther information to be given in connection with an application\nunder clause 83 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember for an international production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART\nIntelligence and Security member directs.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to national security  Part 4\nInternational production orders relating to interception: national security  Division 2\n\nClause 89\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ninterception",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-88-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-88-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9ed5760720b71b3935c71f25cf7389ea898dbae9079f978af6b78caeaa954b5d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-88",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "88 Giving further information to nominated ART Intelligence and",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "Security member\n\n(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require\nfurther information to be given in connection with an application\nunder clause 83 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember for an international production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART\nIntelligence and Security member directs.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to national security  Part 4\nInternational production orders relating to interception: national security  Division 2\n\nClause 89\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ninterception"
    },
