    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-105",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "105 Information to be given on telephone application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-105"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.204",
      "values:originalText": "The information given to a nominated ART Intelligence and\nSecurity member in connection with a telephone application under\nclause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember:\n\n(a) must include particulars of the urgent circumstances because\nof which the person making the application on the\nOrganisation’s behalf thinks it necessary to make the\napplication by telephone; and\n\n(b) must include each matter that, if the application had been\nmade in writing, clause 103 or 104 would have required the\napplication, or an affidavit accompanying it, to set out; and\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to national security  Part 4\nInternational production orders relating to telecommunications data: national security",
      "skos:definition": "The information given to a nominated ART Intelligence and\nSecurity member in connection with a telephone application under\nclause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember:\n\n(a) must include particulars of the urgent circumstances because\nof which the person making the application on the\nOrganisation’s behalf thinks it necessary to make the\napplication by telephone; and\n\n(b) must include each matter that, if the application had been\nmade in writing, clause 103 or 104 would have required the\napplication, or an affidavit accompanying it, to set out; and\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to national security  Part 4\nInternational production orders relating to telecommunications data: national security",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-105-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-105-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8795b4e2f4b009cc1f848bba647699bd4b1064770badb1e23adba5267cac8497",
      "skos:note": "Information must be provided on telephone application",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-105",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "105 Information to be given on telephone application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 204,
      "values:originalText": "The information given to a nominated ART Intelligence and\nSecurity member in connection with a telephone application under\nclause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember:\n\n(a) must include particulars of the urgent circumstances because\nof which the person making the application on the\nOrganisation’s behalf thinks it necessary to make the\napplication by telephone; and\n\n(b) must include each matter that, if the application had been\nmade in writing, clause 103 or 104 would have required the\napplication, or an affidavit accompanying it, to set out; and\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nInternational production orders relating to national security  Part 4\nInternational production orders relating to telecommunications data: national security"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-105-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-105"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-105-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-106",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "106 Giving further information to nominated ART Intelligence and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-106"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "Security member\n\n(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require\nfurther information to be given in connection with an application\nunder clause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember for an international production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART\nIntelligence and Security member directs.\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ntelecommunications data",
      "skos:definition": "Security member\n\n(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require\nfurther information to be given in connection with an application\nunder clause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember for an international production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART\nIntelligence and Security member directs.\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ntelecommunications data",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-106-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-106-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9ed5760720b71b3935c71f25cf7389ea898dbae9079f978af6b78caeaa954b5d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-106",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "106 Giving further information to nominated ART Intelligence and",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "Security member\n\n(1) A nominated ART Intelligence and Security member may require\nfurther information to be given in connection with an application\nunder clause 101 to the nominated ART Intelligence and Security\nmember for an international production order.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) must be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) must be given orally or otherwise, as the nominated ART\nIntelligence and Security member directs.\nSubdivision B—International production orders relating to\ntelecommunications data"
    },
    {
