    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-107",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "107 Issue of international production order—national security",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-107"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.205",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to\na nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an\ninternational production order that:\n\n(a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and\n\n(b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.\nIssue of international production order\n\n(2) If the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member is\nsatisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated\nART Intelligence and Security member under this Division in\nconnection with the application, that:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to\na nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an\ninternational production order that:\n\n(a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and\n\n(b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.\nIssue of international production order\n\n(2) If the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member is\nsatisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated\nART Intelligence and Security member under this Division in\nconnection with the application, that:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-107-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-107-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-107",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "107 Issue of international production order—national security",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 205,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This clause applies if the Organisation applies, under clause 101, to\na nominated ART Intelligence and Security member for an\ninternational production order that:\n\n(a) is in respect of a particular person (the relevant person); and\n\n(b) is directed to a prescribed communications provider.\nIssue of international production order\n\n(2) If the nominated ART Intelligence and Security member is\nsatisfied, on the basis of the information given to the nominated\nART Intelligence and Security member under this Division in\nconnection with the application, that:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders"
    },
