      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-116-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "116(1) Revocation of international production orders—the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an international production order was issued under Part 4 of this\nSchedule, the Director-General of Security:\n\n(a) may revoke the order; and\n\n(b) must revoke the order if the Director-General of Security is\nsatisfied that the grounds on which the order was issued have\nceased to exist."
    },
