      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is revoked under\nclause 116; and\n\n(b) when the revocation takes effect, the Australian Designated\nAuthority has not made a decision about the order under\nclause 112;\nclause 112 ceases to apply to the order when the revocation takes\neffect.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is revoked under\nclause 116; and\n\n(b) when the revocation takes effect, the Australian Designated\nAuthority has not made a decision about the order under\nclause 112;\nclause 112 ceases to apply to the order when the revocation takes\neffect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-117"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-117-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "84f90840c46b47a5c9dbf8d404a15001cd446144d9974b3ea7ed7a2caf3c991f",
      "skos:note": "Clauses 112 ceases to apply when revocation takes effect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-117-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "117(4) Giving of instrument of revocation—the Organisation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is revoked under\nclause 116; and\n\n(b) when the revocation takes effect, the Australian Designated\nAuthority has not made a decision about the order under\nclause 112;\nclause 112 ceases to apply to the order when the revocation takes\neffect."
    },
