      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The chief officer of a relevant agency may, by writing, delegate\nany or all of the chief officer’s functions or powers under this Part\nto a certifying officer of the agency.\n\n(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation\nunder subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions\nof the chief officer.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The chief officer of a relevant agency may, by writing, delegate\nany or all of the chief officer’s functions or powers under this Part\nto a certifying officer of the agency.\n\n(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation\nunder subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions\nof the chief officer.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
