    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-119",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "119 Delegation by the Director-General of Security",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-119"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.220",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Director-General of Security may, by writing, delegate any or\nall of the Director-General of Security’s functions or powers under\nthis Part to a person who is:\n\n(a) a Deputy Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) an ASIO employee.\n\n(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation\nunder subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions\nof the Director-General of Security.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nObjections to, and cancellation of, international production orders  Part 7\n\nClause 120\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Director-General of Security may, by writing, delegate any or\nall of the Director-General of Security’s functions or powers under\nthis Part to a person who is:\n\n(a) a Deputy Director-General of Security; or\n\n(b) an ASIO employee.\n\n(2) In performing functions, or exercising powers, under a delegation\nunder subclause (1), the delegate must comply with any directions\nof the Director-General of Security.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nObjections to, and cancellation of, international production orders  Part 7\n\nClause 120\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
