      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.226",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014,\nas it applies in relation to a civil penalty provision in this Part,\nextends to acts, omissions, matters and things outside Australia.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nReporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nClause 127\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers (Standard Provisions) Act 2014,\nas it applies in relation to a civil penalty provision in this Part,\nextends to acts, omissions, matters and things outside Australia.\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nReporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9\nIntroduction  Division 1\n\nClause 127\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-126"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
