      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.232",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies to information:\n\n(a) included in a report given to the Minister:\n\n(i) under clause 128 by the chief officer of a relevant\nagency; or\n\n(ii) under clause 130 by the Australian Designated\nAuthority; and\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nReporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9\nReporting requirements  Division 2\n\nClause 132\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) that the Minister would, apart from this clause, be required to\ninclude in the next Ministerial report.\nExclusion of information—relevant agency",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies to information:\n\n(a) included in a report given to the Minister:\n\n(i) under clause 128 by the chief officer of a relevant\nagency; or\n\n(ii) under clause 130 by the Australian Designated\nAuthority; and\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nReporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9\nReporting requirements  Division 2\n\nClause 132\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) that the Minister would, apart from this clause, be required to\ninclude in the next Ministerial report.\nExclusion of information—relevant agency",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "402b75fbf869ee660c44c783c0c7ab5f731416f6f1008414e1b9f811392fb62c",
      "skos:note": "The Minister must not include certain information in the report."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-132-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "132(1) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 232,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies to information:\n\n(a) included in a report given to the Minister:\n\n(i) under clause 128 by the chief officer of a relevant\nagency; or\n\n(ii) under clause 130 by the Australian Designated\nAuthority; and\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nReporting and record-keeping requirements  Part 9\nReporting requirements  Division 2\n\nClause 132\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) that the Minister would, apart from this clause, be required to\ninclude in the next Ministerial report.\nExclusion of information—relevant agency"
    },
