      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.232",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies; and\n\n(b) the chief officer of the relevant agency is satisfied that the\ninformation is Part 5.3 information;\nthe chief officer must advise the Minister in writing not to include\nthe information in the next Ministerial report.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n\n(a) subparagraph (1)(a)(i) applies; and\n\n(b) the chief officer of the relevant agency is satisfied that the\ninformation is Part 5.3 information;\nthe chief officer must advise the Minister in writing not to include\nthe information in the next Ministerial report.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
