    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "132(3) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-132-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.232",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Minister is satisfied, on the advice of the chief officer, that\nthe information is Part 5.3 information, the Minister must:\n\n(a) notify the chief officer in writing; and\n\n(b) not include the information in any Ministerial report until the\nMinister decides otherwise under subclause (5).\nInclusion of information in subsequent report—relevant agency",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the Minister is satisfied, on the advice of the chief officer, that\nthe information is Part 5.3 information, the Minister must:\n\n(a) notify the chief officer in writing; and\n\n(b) not include the information in any Ministerial report until the\nMinister decides otherwise under subclause (5).\nInclusion of information in subsequent report—relevant agency",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6384e60831464b31cc87c43b3c751b660f422ea5d3206c135f5ee237776c0f1f",
      "skos:note": "Minister must notify chief officer in writing and not include information in report until decided otherwise."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-132-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "132(3) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 232,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Minister is satisfied, on the advice of the chief officer, that\nthe information is Part 5.3 information, the Minister must:\n\n(a) notify the chief officer in writing; and\n\n(b) not include the information in any Ministerial report until the\nMinister decides otherwise under subclause (5).\nInclusion of information in subsequent report—relevant agency"
    },
