      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "132(4) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-132-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.232",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the information has not been included in a Ministerial report\nbecause of subclause (3), the chief officer must, before the Minister\nprepares the next Ministerial report:\n\n(a) reconsider whether the information is Part 5.3 information;\nand\n\n(b) if the chief officer is satisfied that the information is not",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the information has not been included in a Ministerial report\nbecause of subclause (3), the chief officer must, before the Minister\nprepares the next Ministerial report:\n\n(a) reconsider whether the information is Part 5.3 information;\nand\n\n(b) if the chief officer is satisfied that the information is not",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "10192f651ad462156773d461e9bbb5e5d13646acac8c6737d08423dc385ee227",
      "skos:note": "Chief officer must reconsider information before Minister prepares next report."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-132-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "132(4) Deferral of inclusion of information in Ministerial report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 232,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the information has not been included in a Ministerial report\nbecause of subclause (3), the chief officer must, before the Minister\nprepares the next Ministerial report:\n\n(a) reconsider whether the information is Part 5.3 information;\nand\n\n(b) if the chief officer is satisfied that the information is not"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-132-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
