      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, prescribe kinds of\ndocuments and other materials that the chief officer of a relevant\nagency must cause to be kept in the agency’s records.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, prescribe kinds of\ndocuments and other materials that the chief officer of a relevant\nagency must cause to be kept in the agency’s records.\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "values:partOf": {
