      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.250",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) an international production order was issued under clause 98;\nand\n\n(b) in compliance with the order, a prescribed communications\nprovider makes a copy of stored communications available to\nthe Organisation (whether directly or indirectly via the\nAustralian Designated Authority); and\n\n(c) the copy is in the Organisation’s possession; and\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n\n(a) an international production order was issued under clause 98;\nand\n\n(b) in compliance with the order, a prescribed communications\nprovider makes a copy of stored communications available to\nthe Organisation (whether directly or indirectly via the\nAustralian Designated Authority); and\n\n(c) the copy is in the Organisation’s possession; and\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
