      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "143(4) Inspection of records—Australian Designated Authority",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 254,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Australian Designated Authority must ensure that members of\nstaff of the Attorney-General’s Department give the Ombudsman\nany assistance the Ombudsman reasonably requires to enable the\nOmbudsman to perform functions under this clause."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-143-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
