    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-144",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "144 Power to obtain relevant information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-144"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.255",
      "values:originalText": "Relevant agency\n\n(1) If the Ombudsman has reasonable grounds to believe that an\nofficer of a particular relevant agency is able to give information\nrelevant to an inspection under this Part of the relevant agency’s\nrecords, the Ombudsman may:\n\n(a) if the Ombudsman knows the officer’s identity—by written\nnotice given to the officer, require the officer to do one or\nboth of the following:\n\n(i) give the information to the Ombudsman, by writing\nsigned by the officer, at a specified place and within a\nspecified period;\n\n(ii) attend before a specified inspecting officer to answer\nquestions relevant to the inspection; or\n\n(b) if the Ombudsman does not know the officer’s identity—\nrequire the chief officer of the relevant agency, or a person\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "Relevant agency\n\n(1) If the Ombudsman has reasonable grounds to believe that an\nofficer of a particular relevant agency is able to give information\nrelevant to an inspection under this Part of the relevant agency’s\nrecords, the Ombudsman may:\n\n(a) if the Ombudsman knows the officer’s identity—by written\nnotice given to the officer, require the officer to do one or\nboth of the following:\n\n(i) give the information to the Ombudsman, by writing\nsigned by the officer, at a specified place and within a\nspecified period;\n\n(ii) attend before a specified inspecting officer to answer\nquestions relevant to the inspection; or\n\n(b) if the Ombudsman does not know the officer’s identity—\nrequire the chief officer of the relevant agency, or a person\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-144-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-144-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-144-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "42c72aea7ad8114df84b8262daa12487d10c3180074f14d51967396aea7cb512",
      "skos:note": "Ombudsman may require officer to provide information or attend inspection"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-144",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "144 Power to obtain relevant information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 255,
      "values:originalText": "Relevant agency\n\n(1) If the Ombudsman has reasonable grounds to believe that an\nofficer of a particular relevant agency is able to give information\nrelevant to an inspection under this Part of the relevant agency’s\nrecords, the Ombudsman may:\n\n(a) if the Ombudsman knows the officer’s identity—by written\nnotice given to the officer, require the officer to do one or\nboth of the following:\n\n(i) give the information to the Ombudsman, by writing\nsigned by the officer, at a specified place and within a\nspecified period;\n\n(ii) attend before a specified inspecting officer to answer\nquestions relevant to the inspection; or\n\n(b) if the Ombudsman does not know the officer’s identity—\nrequire the chief officer of the relevant agency, or a person\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders"
    },
    {
