      "values:originalText": "(1) Protected information that:\n\n(a) consists of telecommunications data obtained in accordance\nwith an international production order; or\n\n(b) relates to such an international production order;\nmay be used, recorded or disclosed, or may be admitted in\nevidence, for any of the following purposes:\n\n(c) the enforcement of the criminal law;\n\n(d) the enforcement of a law imposing a pecuniary penalty;\n\n(e) the protection of the public revenue.\n\n(2) If the Australian Federal Police, or a Police Force of a State has\nbeen notified that a person is missing, protected information that\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
