      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) an international production order is directed to a prescribed\ncommunications provider; and\n\n(b) the provider is not an individual;\na manager of the provider may issue a written certificate signed by\nthe manager setting out such facts as the manager considers\nrelevant with respect to acts or things done by the provider in order\nto comply with the international production order.",
