      "values:originalText": "(2) A certifying officer of a Part 5.3 IPO agency may issue a written\ncertificate signed by the officer setting out such facts as the officer\nconsiders relevant with respect to:\n\n(a) the receipt by the agency of:\n\n(i) intercepted communications; or\n\n(ii) intercepted messages; or\n\n(iii) intercepted voice calls; or\n\n(iv) intercepted video calls;\n\nthat were made available to the agency in accordance with an\ninternational production order issued under clause 60; or\n\n(b) the receipt by the agency of telecommunications data that\nwas disclosed to the agency in accordance with an\ninternational production order issued under clause 60."
