    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "171 Electronic service of documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-171"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.299",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto a person by the Australian Designated Authority:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\n(iii) an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order;\n\n(iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international\nproduction order; and\n\n(b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in\na document given by the person to the Australian Designated\nAuthority;\nthe order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the\nperson if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto the Australian Designated Authority by a person, a\nrelevant agency or the Organisation:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto a person by the Australian Designated Authority:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\n(iii) an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order;\n\n(iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international\nproduction order; and\n\n(b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in\na document given by the person to the Australian Designated\nAuthority;\nthe order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the\nperson if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto the Australian Designated Authority by a person, a\nrelevant agency or the Organisation:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "14902bf1c428442ecf43cbfcee7acde058fcea1c3caa2e40a6124bd87f656654"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-171",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "171 Electronic service of documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 299,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto a person by the Australian Designated Authority:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\n(iii) an instrument of revocation of an international\nproduction order;\n\n(iv) an instrument of cancellation of an international\nproduction order; and\n\n(b) the person has nominated an electronic address for service in\na document given by the person to the Australian Designated\nAuthority;\nthe order, copy or instrument is taken to have been given to the\nperson if it is sent to the nominated electronic address for service.\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) any of the following is required by this Schedule to be given\nto the Australian Designated Authority by a person, a\nrelevant agency or the Organisation:\n\n(i) an international production order;\n\n(ii) a certified copy of an international production order;\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-171-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "171(1) Electronic service of documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-171-ss-1"
