      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.303",
      "values:originalText": "agency\nInterception\n\n(1) A document certified in writing by a certifying officer of a Part 5.3\nIPO agency to be a true copy of an international production order\nissued under clause 60 is to be received in evidence in:\n\n(a) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for an offence against:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "skos:definition": "agency\nInterception\n\n(1) A document certified in writing by a certifying officer of a Part 5.3\nIPO agency to be a true copy of an international production order\nissued under clause 60 is to be received in evidence in:\n\n(a) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for an offence against:\n\nSchedule 1  International production orders",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
