      "skos:note": "Exhibit certified copy of international production order in court proceedings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-178-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "178(3) Certified copy of international production order—the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 305,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A document certified in writing by a certifying person to be a true\ncopy of an international production order issued under clause 98 is\nto be received in evidence in a proceeding mentioned in clause 153\nor 158 as if it were the original international production order."
    },
