      "values:originalText": "(1) The Australian Designated Authority may, by writing, delegate any\nor all of the Australian Designated Authority’s functions or powers\nunder this Schedule to:\n\n(a) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the\nAttorney-General’s Department; or\n\n(b) an APS employee who holds, or is acting in, an Executive\nLevel 1 or 2 position in the Attorney-General’s Department.\nNote:\nThe expressions SES employee, acting SES employee and APS\nemployee are defined in section 2B of the Acts Interpretation Act\n1901."
