    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-180-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "180(2) Minor defects in connection with international production order",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-180-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.306",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in\nrelation to an international production order means a defect or\nirregularity:\n\n(a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and\n\n(b) that is:\n\n(i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document\npurporting to be the international production order; or\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nMiscellaneous  Part 14\n\nClause 181\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) in connection with compliance with the international\nproduction order; or\n\n(iii) in connection with purported compliance with a\ndocument purporting to be the international production\norder.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in\nrelation to an international production order means a defect or\nirregularity:\n\n(a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and\n\n(b) that is:\n\n(i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document\npurporting to be the international production order; or\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nMiscellaneous  Part 14\n\nClause 181\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) in connection with compliance with the international\nproduction order; or\n\n(iii) in connection with purported compliance with a\ndocument purporting to be the international production\norder.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-180"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sch-1-sec-180-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a778cc0519a6b2d8c7444a4015cbf6c1b1d56b339d61452515902f0f5d8e154b",
      "skos:note": "Defect or irregularity in relation to an international production order means a defect or irregularity that is not substantial and related to the issue of a document purporting to be the international production order, compliance with the international production order, or purported compliance."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sch-1-sec-180-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180(2) Minor defects in connection with international production order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 306,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subclause (1), a defect or irregularity in\nrelation to an international production order means a defect or\nirregularity:\n\n(a) that is not a substantial defect or irregularity; and\n\n(b) that is:\n\n(i) in, or in connection with the issue of, a document\npurporting to be the international production order; or\n\nInternational production orders  Schedule 1\nMiscellaneous  Part 14\n\nClause 181\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) in connection with compliance with the international\nproduction order; or\n\n(iii) in connection with purported compliance with a\ndocument purporting to be the international production\norder."
    },
